      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"DefaultSelfLinkProvider.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core.support\"><code>DefaultSelfLinkProvider</code></a> from the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/PersistentEntities.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>PersistentEntities</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/EntityLinks.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas.server\"><code>EntityLinks</code></a> and\n<a href=\"EntityLookup.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.rest.core.support\"><code>EntityLookup</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "根据 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/PersistentEntities.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>PersistentEntities</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/EntityLinks.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.hateoas.server\"><code>EntityLinks</code></a> 以及 <a href=\"EntityLookup.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.rest.core.support\"><code>EntityLookup</code></a>s，创建一个新的 <a href=\"DefaultSelfLinkProvider.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.rest.core.support\"><code>DefaultSelfLinkProvider</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
