    {
      "source": "Default implementation of SelfLinkProvider that uses an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/EntityLinks.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas.server\"><code>EntityLinks</code></a> instance to create self links. Considers\nthe configured <a href=\"EntityLookup.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.rest.core.support\"><code>EntityLookup</code></a>s to use the returned resource identifier to eventually create the link.",
      "translation": "SelfLinkProvider 的默认实现，使用一个 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/EntityLinks.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas.server\"><code>EntityLinks</code></a>` 实例来创建自链接。该实现会考虑已配置的 `<a href=\"EntityLookup.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.rest.core.support\"><code>EntityLookup</code></a>`，利用其返回的资源标识符最终构建链接。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"SelfLinkProvider.html#createSelfLinkFor(java.lang.Object)\">SelfLinkProvider</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"SelfLinkProvider.html#createSelfLinkFor(java.lang.Object)\">SelfLinkProvider</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"SelfLinkProvider.html#createSelfLinkFor(java.lang.Class,java.lang.Object)\">SelfLinkProvider</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"SelfLinkProvider.html#createSelfLinkFor(java.lang.Class,java.lang.Object)\">SelfLinkProvider</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the self link for the given entity instance. Only call this with an actual entity instance. Otherwise,\nprefer <a href=\"SelfLinkProvider.html#createSelfLinkFor(java.lang.Class,java.lang.Object)\"><code>SelfLinkProvider.createSelfLinkFor(Class, Object)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定实体实例的自链接。仅针对实际的实体实例调用此方法；否则，请优先使用 <a href=\"SelfLinkProvider.html#createSelfLinkFor(java.lang.Class,java.lang.Object)\"><code>SelfLinkProvider.createSelfLinkFor(Class, Object)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the self link for the entity of the given type and the given reference.",
      "translation": "返回给定类型和引用的实体的自链接。",
      "count": 1
